Description: face unlock for KDE Plasma, sudo and polkit
 Linux Hello unlocks the Plasma lock screen and authenticates sudo and
 polkit prompts with your face, using an infrared camera when there is one.
 Set it up in System Settings > Security & Privacy > Face Unlock.
 .
 Ships its own Python runtime with OpenCV and dlib.
